+    *   **Cube (7^3):** 2024 MC triangles, 1720 H triangles, 304 NH triangles. NH removal rate 89%, Global removal rate 98% [S1].
+    *   **Cube (10^3):** 3656 MC triangles, 2200 H triangles, 1456 NH triangles. NH removal rate 37%, Global removal rate 75% [S1].
