+*   **History:** The work builds upon the Object Boundary Quantization (OBQ) model and previous research on digital plane segmentation [S1]. It addresses the difficulties of exploiting 3D discrete volumes (such as those from MRI/CT scans) by providing a compact, reversible polygonal representation [S1].
